'''Moons''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2016 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2016|2016 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance==
Its blade is black and appears to be portraying 3 phases of the moon from left to right; a waxing crescent, a full moon, and a waning crescent. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black. 

==Trivia== 
*This knife was obtained from the first Halloween event box ever in [[Murder Mystery 2]].

